        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Omushoro gwa hekalu n'ekicweka kya shekeli ekyabaire kishorwa Omuyudaaya weena buri mwaka. Reeba Okuruga 30:12-16.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omushoro gwa hekalu baija ahari Petero, baamubuuza bati: Beitu omwegyesa waanyu tashora? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabagarukamu ati: Naashora. Ku yaataahire omu nju, Yesu yaaba niwe yaabanza kumubuuza ati: Nooteekateeka ota, Simooni? Abagabe b'ensi ehoozi n'omushoro babiheebwa bantu ki? Abaana baabo nari abantu abandi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yaamugarukiremu ati, Abandi, Yesu yaamugambira ati: Mbwenu abaana baabo baine obusingye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka itwe tutabagwisa kubi, ogyende aha nyanja, otegyese eirobo, eky'enyanja eki oraabanze kukwata, okyashamure, omu kanwa kaakyo noija kushangamu sitateeri; obe niyo waabaha ahabwangye n'ahabwawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
